<details name="doom-help" data-doom-control-help>
  <summary>Controls</summary>
  <div class="doom-help-content space-y-3">
    <p>Keyboard: arrows move · Ctrl/J fire · Space/K use · Shift/Alt strafe · Escape menu · Enter confirm. Drag outside controls to rotate the badge. Scroll to zoom.</p>
    <p>Touch: hold the direction and action buttons to move or fire. Hold Strafe + a direction to sidestep. Use Screen for a closer view or Full to pose the whole badge.</p>
  </div>
</details>
